[center][img]https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Edgemodders/REDnode/main/packs/ui-tools/nexus/brand/banner.png[/img][/center]

[center][size=5][b][color=#fcee0a]Read Night City's own UI. Pick any widget. Build native UI of your own.[/color][/b][/size][/center]

[center][size=3]REDnode UI Tools is an app pack for UI modders. Its UI Workbench shows the game's own interface, the ink widgets the engine draws, as a live tree: point at any piece of the HUD or a menu and it tells you what it is, where it came from and every property it has. Then write native UI of your own in ink markup, HTML-style tags the game draws as its own.[/size][/center]

[line]

[quote][size=4][b][color=#fcee0a]STATUS: PREVIEW[/color][/b][/size]
Built in the open and tested in the game on game version 2.5. It runs on [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/35419]REDnode[/url] and [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/cyberpunk2077/mods/7780]Codeware[/url], which you need first. Inspect only reads the game's UI; Try changes a widget only until you press Reset or close the Workbench, and nothing is ever saved into the game.
[b]UI modders:[/b] this is for you. [b]Players:[/b] you do not need it to play UI mods.[/quote][line]

[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/3333/images/36958/36958-1793701401-872708489.png[/img]

